date   = 2026-09-17

Library/Fonts and Library/Desktop Pictures are installed in
/System/Library by tools/desktop/install-gershwin-system.sh, which
foxyn-desktop(8) runs on the desktop image; it downloads this revision's
archive and checks its SHA-256. The fonts carry their own licenses (Inter:
OFL 1.1; URW and Nimbus Sans: AGPL 3 with a font exception; Luxi:
Bigelow & Holmes). When upgrading, update the revision and checksum in
that script too.
License: no root license file found; individual asset provenance and redistribution terms remain unverified. Complete provenance review and preserve applicable notices
and source obligations before distributing selected components.
On upgrade, review dependencies, ABI, installation paths and desktop tests.
